.TH GUM 1 "2026-08-20" "gum" "A tool for glamorous shell scripts."
.SH "نام (NAME)"
gum \- A tool for glamorous shell scripts\&.
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBgum\fP [\fIoptions\&.\&.\&.\fP] [\fIargument\&.\&.\&.\fP]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
